supporting the nominee of the Republican Party.&nbsp;

00:02:49.549 --> 00:02:52.680
Speaker 2: You can't see a scenario where&nbsp;
Donald Trump would just skip the debate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.680 --> 00:02:56.580
if he's forced to sign something saying, I.
Speaker 4: Want to be on the debate stage.&nbsp;&nbsp;

